sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant FE as Frontend (browser)
  participant CORE as Core API
  participant V as Voice API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  U->>FE: Start voice call
  FE->>CORE: POST /assistant/voice/calls
  CORE->>V: POST /voice/web/sessions
  V->>DB: Insert voice_sessions
  V-->>CORE: session id
  loop Each spoken turn
    U->>FE: Speak (microphone recording)
    FE->>CORE: POST /assistant/voice/calls/:id/turn (audio, base64)
    CORE->>V: /sessions/:id/listen
    V->>V: Speech-to-text (faster-whisper, Bangla/English)
    V->>DB: Insert voice_turns (CALLER)
    V-->>CORE: text + language
    CORE->>CORE: askService.ask(text, channel VOICE) — same answer flow as text
    CORE->>V: /sessions/:id/speak (answer text)
    V->>V: Text-to-speech (MMS: mms-tts-ben / mms-tts-eng)
    V->>DB: Insert voice_turns (ASSISTANT)
    V-->>CORE: WAV audio (base64)
    CORE-->>FE: answer text + audio
    FE-->>U: Play answer (text still shown if speech fails)
  end
  U->>FE: End call
  FE->>CORE: POST /assistant/voice/calls/:id/end
  CORE->>V: /sessions/:id/end
